Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.84,0:00:33.87,一般,,0,0,0,,Me and my shadow, we take a photo where the horizon meets the sky.\N我和我的影子，在天地相接的地方留下一张合照。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.87,0:00:39.47,一般,,0,0,0,,My fallen angel, wearing my wet clothes, breathing the scent of you inside.\N我坠落的天使，穿着我湿透的衣裳，呼吸着你的气息。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.47,0:00:44.77,一般,,0,0,0,,Turn in the light up, squeezing a waterfall from the corner of\N把灯光调亮，从角落处拧出一挂瀑布
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.77,0:00:47.80,一般,,0,0,0,,water from the corner of\N从角落的水里
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.80,0:00:54.31,一般,,0,0,0,,I saw the light from the corner of my eye.\N我看见光从我眼角闪过。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.25,0:01:20.00,一般,,0,0,0,,Me and my shadow, we are in danger. We don't know how to live with die.\N我和我的影子，身处险境。我们不知道该如何与死亡共存。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:22.98,一般,,0,0,0,,My fallen angel, why do you want me?\N我坠落的天使，你为何想要我？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.98,0:01:25.98,一般,,0,0,0,,Why do you come to me at night?\N你为何在夜晚来到我身边？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.98,0:01:30.84,一般,,0,0,0,,Deep in my bedroom,tell me my mission that comes from up above.\N在我卧室深处，告诉我那来自上方的使命。
